-\text{result} = \text{mix}(d_2, d_1, h) - k \cdot h \cdot (1.0 - h)
-$$
-Where $d_1, d_2$ are distances and $k$ is the blending factor.
-
-**Hable Tone Mapping** [S1, unofficial]:
-$$
-\text{result} = \frac{x(Ax + CB) + DE}{x(Ax + B) + DF} - \frac{E}{F}
